@ApprovalFlow_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133
# Pega aquí el accessToken devuelto por el login.
@token =

### Login (Admin sembrado en Development)
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@approvalflow.local",
  "password": "Admin-Dev-123"
}

### Listar usuarios (Admin)
GET {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/users
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Usuario autenticado
GET {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear usuario (Admin). Roles: 1 = Admin, 2 = Requester, 3 = Approver, 4 = Finance
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "fullName": "Ana Solicitante",
  "email": "ana@approvalflow.local",
  "password": "Clave-Segura-123",
  "role": 2,
  "departmentId": null
}

### Cambiar mi contraseña
PUT {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin-Dev-123",
  "newPassword": "Nueva-Clave-456"
}

### Listar departamentos (cualquier usuario autenticado)
GET {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener departamento por id (cualquier usuario autenticado)
GET {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear departamento (Admin)
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Compras",
  "description": "Área de compras"
}

### Editar departamento (Admin)
PUT {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Adquisiciones",
  "description": "Nueva descripción"
}

### Activar departamento (Admin)
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desactivar departamento (Admin). 409 si tiene usuarios activos
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/departments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar solicitudes de compra (según rol). Filtro opcional ?status=: 1 = Pending, 2 = InReview, 3 = Approved, 4 = Rejected, 5 = Cancelled
GET {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests?status=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener solicitud por id (404 si no es visible para el usuario)
GET {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear solicitud (Requester)
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Laptops para el equipo",
  "justification": "Renovación de equipos obsoletos",
  "totalAmount": 1500.50
}

### Editar solicitud (Requester dueño, solo en Pending)
PUT {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Monitores",
  "justification": "Nuevos monitores",
  "totalAmount": 300.00
}

### Cancelar solicitud (Requester dueño, solo en Pending)
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Iniciar revisión (Approver del departamento, solo en Pending)
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/start-review
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aprobar solicitud (Approver del departamento, solo en InReview). El comentario es opcional
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "comments": "Aprobada"
}

### Rechazar solicitud (Approver del departamento, solo en InReview). El comentario es obligatorio
POST {{ApprovalFlow_HostAddress}}/api/purchase-requests/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "comments": "Sin presupuesto"
}
